lueberry\n\nBlueberry bush (Patch 5): a dense, round, low shrub of small blue-green leaves with clusters of dark blue berries.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -15..17, y 0..24, z -16..15 units. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 63 (full 48, picked 15).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default)\n- `picked`: the shrub with no berries"}